'''Team Nemesis''' is a [[:Category:Singapore|Singaporean]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2

|content1=
* July 30th - '''Team Nemesis''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a lineup consisting of [[Thomas]], [[CRUC1AL]], [[tein]], [[bevve]], [[Frip]], and [[robiin]] as coach. <ref name="team nemesis">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/1950617393912328413|title=time for the king to reclaim his throne|date=2025-07-30|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* September 9th - '''Team Nemesis''' part ways with [[robiin]] and sign [[Rickertje]] as their new coach. <ref name="+rickertje">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/1965460307280871682|title=adding more brains to the CS team|date=2025-09-09|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* October 11th - '''Team Nemesis''' part ways with [[bevve]] and [[Frip]]. <ref name="-bevve/frip">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/1977034230787195165|title=Thank you @bevvexyz and @FripCS|date=2025-10-11|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* October 21st - '''Team Nemesis''' sign [[Nexius]] and acquire [[n0te]] from [[Lazer Cats]]. <ref name="+nexius/n0te">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/1980680480099037312|title=Welcome @NexiusCS2 and @n0teCSGO to the Team Nemesis CS2 main roster|date=2025-10-21|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 4th - '''Team Nemesis''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="-nemesis 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/2007905673569611978|title=End of an era for our CS2 EU squad|date=2026-01-04|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* January 13th - '''Team Nemesis''' sign the former [[GUN5 Esports]]' roster consisting of [[SELLTER]], [[Sdaim]], [[tex1y]], [[mag1k3Y]], [[yiksrezo]], [[NMV]], and [[mzng]], the latter two as coach and analyst, respectively. <ref name="ex-gun5">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/2011105961822265384|title=de_train has been removed from the map pool and entered the Team Nemesis roster|date=2026-01-13|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* February 27th - '''Team Nemesis''' bench [[yiksrezo]] and acquire [[r3salt]] from [[9Pandas]]. <ref name="+r3salt">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/2027398316250865945|title=And now for the real announcement…|date=2026-02-27|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* May 22nd - '''Team Nemesis''' part ways with [[mzng]]. <ref name="-mzng">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/mzngcs/91|title=всем прив|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Hey everyone|date=2026-05-22|author=[[mzng]]}}</ref>
* September 16th - '''Team Nemesis''' part ways with [[yiksrezo]]. <ref name="-yiksrezo">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/nmss_gg/1005|title=yiksrezo, мы рады, что ты был частью нашего пути в CS2|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=yiksrezo, we’re glad you were part of our CS2 journey|date=2026-09-16|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''Team Nemesis''' bench [[NMV]]. <ref name="nmv bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/2104617132080484701|title=We would like to thank NMV for being a pivotal piece in what we have already achieved with this roster|date=2026-09-28|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
* October 5th - '''Team Nemesis''' sign [[brain]] as their new coach. <ref name="+brain">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/2107093492812103751|title=New coach, new chapter|date=2026-10-05|author='''Team Nemesis'''}}</ref>
}}

